  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From work-energy theorem&nbsp;<br />For upward motion <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>m</mtext> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>mgh</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>W</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;(work by air resistance)<br />For downward motion <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>m</mtext> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>mgh</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>W</mtext> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>gh</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;</p><p>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
